qs.append({"q":"Bipan Chandra classified the people's resistance movements against British rule before 1857 into which categories?","o":["Civil rebellions, tribal uprisings and peasant movements","Only civil rebellions and sepoy mutinies","Only tribal uprisings and peasant movements","Religious movements and civil disobedience only"],"a":0,"e":"Bipan Chandra broadly classified pre-1857 resistance into civil rebellions, tribal uprisings, and peasant movements (with sepoy mutinies as a related but distinct military strand)."})

qs.append({"q":"Consider the following statements regarding the causes of people's resistance against British rule before 1857:\n1. Colonial land revenue settlements imposed heavy new taxes and evicted peasants from land.\n2. Expansion of revenue administration encroached upon tribal lands.\n3. Destruction of indigenous industry promoted British manufactured goods.\n4. British rule ended patronage to the priestly and scholarly classes.\nHow many of the above statements are correct?","o":["Only one","Only two","Only three","All four"],"a":3,"e":"All four were genuine factors: revenue settlements and taxation, encroachment on tribal land, destruction of indigenous industries, and loss of patronage to priestly/scholarly classes."},)

